    "text_sample": " United States Department of Agriculture\nAgricultural Marketing Service\nLog In\nRegister\nHome\nSearch\nReports\nTrade Partners\nContact Us   About  \nData History\n\nEach month we publish a snapshot of the full INTEGRITY public data set for USDA-NOP certified operations. The data is captured at the beginning of the month.\n\nMonthly Snapshots – Current Calendar Year\nData Submission Template Format:\nOperations/Scopes and Products on Separate Sheets\nJanuary\nFebruary\nMarch\nApril\nMay\nJune\nJuly\nAugust\nSeptember\nOctober\nNovember\nSearch Results Export Format:\nOperations, Scopes and Certified Products on the Same Sheet\nJanuary\nFebruary\nMarch\nApril\nMay\nJuly\nAugust\nSeptember\nOctober\nNovember\nCounts of Certified Organic Operations:\nBy Country, U.S. State, and Certifier\nJanuary\nFebruary\nMarch\nApril\nMay\nJune\nJuly\nAugust\nSeptember\nOctober\nNovember\nHistorical Data\n\nYou can also download Microsoft Excel workbooks with annual USDA-NOP operation lists. INTEGRITY was launched in 2015, so older lists are in a different format.\n\nData Submission Template Format: Operations/Scopes and Products on Separate Sheets\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\nSearch Results Export Format:\nOperations, Scopes and Certified Products on the Same Sheet\"\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\nCounts of Certified Organic Operations:\nBy Country, U.S. State, and Certifier\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n\nOlder annual operation lists:\n\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n\nDisclaimer: For more up-to-date information about certified organic operations, please contact their certifying agent directly. To find a certifying agent’s contact information, visit our Certifier Locator page.\n\nOperations certified to another organic standard are allowed to export to the U.S. only if covered under an established organic equivalence arrangement. These operations do not appear in these snapshots and historical lists, but can be found in Trade Partner operation information through the Trade Partner menu.\n\n Return to top\nAskUSDA\nPrivacy Policy\nUSDA.gov\nUSA.gov\nWhiteHouse.gov\nFOIA\nAccessibility Statement\nNon-­Discrimination Statement\nInformation Quality\nPlain Writing\nContact USDA",
